OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGSOUTH AFRICAN POLICE
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGCLAMPDOWN ON UNREST
OL,5, South African police have announced
OL,6, tough security measures aimed at
OL,7, quelling unrest in black townships.
OL,9,FThe measures, codenamed "Iron Fist",
OL,10,Finclude roadblocks and night curfews in
OL,11,F27 Johannesburg townships.
OL,13,FMachine-guns would be mounted on police
OL,14,Farmoured cars and hostels for migrant
OL,15,Fworkers, the flashpoints of the unrest,
OL,16,Fwould be sealed off, police said.
OL,18,FA police commissioner said the measures
OL,19,Fwould come into effect next week after
OL,20,Freceiving formal government approval.
OL,23,D]FFromG15-09-90F  teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
